https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QISuv4qoJYM  (Capo 3)

In 1965 The Seekers released two versions, a studio release and a studio "live" version.  They have subtle differences, mainly with how the chord sequence at the end of the verse (D) vs (G).  This is the studio release.

TIP:  The opening riff is repeated once at the end of each verse with the first (G) on "you".

TIP:  If you don't like the (Bm) you can get away with playing an (Em) instead. 


